# notary is deliberately briefs-heavy, skills-light.
#
# a notarization is a human act, performed by a commissioned officer, in the
# presence of the signer. there is very little here for a machine to do.
#
# document PRODUCTION — letterhead, a rendered signature, a signature placed
# onto a pdf — belongs to `secretary`, not here. see readme.md for why that
# boundary carries weight.
